<title>UK: London Elec seen down as Entergy talks end.</title>
<headline>London Elec seen down as Entergy talks end.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in London Electricity are expected to open sharply lower after Entergy of the U.S. said exploratory talks with the UK electricity firm have ended.</p>
</text>
